i>Hand-drawn india ink graphics</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unique character designs based in demonology and a variety of deities</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Quirky humor and branching dialogues in a visual-novel style</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3 main characters to choose from with different personalities</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interactive city with lots of secrets to uncover</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiple endings depending on your actions</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available languages: Spanish, English and Catalan (more in the future!)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
